Bundled fonts:
  * LXGW WenKai (霞鹜文楷)  - SIL Open Font License 1.1
      https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai
      full text: assets/licenses/OFL-LXGWWenKai.txt
      in the built exe: assets/bundle/wenkai.woff
  * Yozai (悠哉字体)         - SIL Open Font License 1.1
      https://github.com/lxgw/yozai-font
      full text: assets/licenses/OFL-Yozai.txt
      in the built exe: assets/bundle/yozai.woff

System fonts (KaiTi, STXingkai, STXinwei, FZShuTi, SimLi, FangSong, Ink Free,
Segoe Script) are NOT distributed by this project. A local build may pack
subsets of fonts already installed on the builder's own Windows system into a
private executable; those outlines remain the property of their respective
vendors (Microsoft Corporation, Founder Electronics / FZ) and are not covered
by the MIT license of this project. Do not redistribute such a build
commercially without checking your own font licenses.

